Z||000004||Oreif||07-11-2000||02:53 AM||||The 85 SE was a base coupe body style. I think 85 was the only year you could get a V-6 with the Base Coupe body style with the exception of the 88 Formula. (It was an option for the 85 SE) 86 SE/85 GT had the aero nose, ground effects, aero back end, and the wing (if ordered)<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-11-2000).]||||reg||1
